{{PCExclusive}}
'''Mimiluga''' is a [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that is exclusive to the VIP [[Tales of the Nekoluga (Gacha Event)|Tales of the Nekoluga]] Gacha, only available in the [[Minna de Nyanko Daisensou|PC version]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 915
|rarity = UR
|version = PC
|name1 = Mimiluga
|name2 = Mimilan Pasalan
|image1 = 10915 1.png
|image2 = 10915 2.png
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Mimilan Pasalan''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
==='''Normal Form'''===
This form is <u>useless by design</u>. Similarly to the other cats from Tales of the Nekoluga, this Cat is not meant to be used until it evolves.

==='''Evolved Form'''===
Use him if you're feeling lucky. The core of his performance relies on how many status effects he inflicts when he's present. If he performs a [[Critical Hit]], he can wipe out an entire wave of Metal enemies instantly, and its range may be very helpful for dealing with enemies that have under 400 range, due to having a decent damage output for its range. Do note that this Mimilan Pasalan is quite fragile compared to other Uber Rares. You'll most certainly regret if you don't protect him properly, so using the [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Eraser Cat]] and [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Wall Cat]] duo is a good idea.

{{Job|Classification = N/A|EvolvedClass = Crowd-Controller & Super-Backliner|TrueClass=|UltraClass=}}

